    "standardized_narrative": "Opening gross claims outstanding at 1 January 2017 were GBP 2,068.0m. During 2017 the syndicate recorded adverse prior-year reserve movement (gross strengthening) of GBP 71.5m (3.46% of opening reserves), driven primarily by a large number of natural catastrophe losses (notably Hurricanes Harvey, Irma and Maria, the Mexican earthquake and California wildfires) and a high volume of larger losses, partially offset by prior period reserve releases (net GBP 22m quoted elsewhere). The reserve movement is therefore overall a strengthening concentrated in property-exposed lines with knock-on impacts across marine, motor and casualty portfolios.",
